whether you actually tested and understand the code you're submitting.\r\n\r\nBefore spending time reviewing a PR to assess whether it's addressing an actual problem and fixing it properly, we need to confirm that we're dealing with a human that did their due diligence.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917019324/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917102199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418#issuecomment-3917102199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116418","id":3917102199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pejx3","user":{"login":"oCHIKIo","id":108464117,"node_id":"U_kgDOBncH9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108464117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo","html_url":"https://github.com/oCHIKIo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T21:09:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T21:09:45Z","body":"I only used ai assistance to draft the PR description, the debugging and implementation were done independently. I should have disclosed that upfront and will do so in future contributions , I identified the issue by running Godot with --verbose and seeing the “Unrecognized output string misc2” warning. The problem was that misc2 was missing from the enum used to index _joy_buttons, causing controller mappings to fail. I added MISC2–6 to match SDL3’s definitions, rebuilt from source, and confirmed the warning no longer appears, please let me know if any further details are needed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917102199/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917178790","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418#issuecomment-3917178790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116418","id":3917178790,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pe2em","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T21:29:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T21:29:25Z","body":"That makes sense, thanks. From a cursory check it seems correct, though we should test to be sure as these arrays can be finicky.\r\n\r\nIt makes sense to me to add all `misc*` entries supported by SDL, I see they add `misc2` to `misc6` in 2024:\r\n- https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/commit/cb70e972e3\r\n- https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/commit/d04fea8b87","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917178790/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917368353","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418#issuecomment-3917368353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116418","id":3917368353,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pfkwh","user":{"login":"oCHIKIo","id":108464117,"node_id":"U_kgDOBncH9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108464117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo","html_url":"https://github.com/oCHIKIo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T22:19:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T22:19:49Z","body":"It looks like the fa